# Components authored by this server. See `.local/interface.sym` for the id-allocation
# reasoning; component ids are derived from their parent interface, so staying clear of
# upstream interface ids is all that is needed here.
#
# Format matches the upstream `component.sym`: `<interface>:<childIndex>` -> `<interface>:<name>`,
# tab separated. `NameLoader.readComponents` resolves the interface half against the merged
# interface map, so a `.local` component may reference a `.local` interface.
#
# Child indices are contiguous from 0 and must match the order authored in
# `content/interfaces/first-login`'s `FirstLoginBuilder`.

